msgid "使用模式"
msgstr "Usage Modes"

#: ../../docs/mode/usage-mode.rst:7 c653d798da4545c2817a14a92c1bc7f8
msgid "模式对比"
msgstr "Mode Comparison"

#: ../../docs/mode/usage-mode.rst:9 381f06460ba446eda263ce0b5afcf52c
msgid ""
"为了满足复杂多样的个性化计算需求，适应新型计算模式对运行环境的复杂要求， 高性能计算平台的建设除了在硬件设备的选型上充分考虑了计算的多样性， "
"提供了包含CPU节点、ARM节点和GPU节点等的丰富算力组合， 在软件平台的建设上也采用了区别于传统超算中心的作业调度系统的解决方案， "
"在不损失计算性能的前提下以灵活多样的方式提供服务。"
msgstr ""
"To meet diverse personalized computing needs and complex runtime "
"requirements of new computing models, the HPC platform not only provides a "
"rich mix of CPU, ARM, and GPU nodes, but also adopts a software approach "
"different from traditional supercomputing job schedulers, delivering "
"flexible services without sacrificing performance."

#: ../../docs/mode/usage-mode.rst:17 8ae8260d0873425fb87555381f1ef75e
msgid ""
"**资源多≠速度快**，无论使用以下哪种方式申请计算资源，并不意味着申请的资源越多，计算速度就会越快。程序必须经过并行计算优化，才能取得更快的计算速度，比如，CPU程序要经过多核优化，GPU程序要利用CUDA加速。"
msgstr ""
"**More resources != faster speed.** Requesting more resources does not "
"automatically make jobs faster. Programs must be optimized for parallel "
"computing--for example, multi-core optimization for CPU programs and CUDA "
"acceleration for GPU programs."

