#: ../../docs/mode/usage-mode.rst:67 f6e4f55ddbab4fe4a26fff3fdf9f35e5
msgid "如上表所示，平台主要支持三种模式："
msgstr "As shown above, the platform mainly supports three modes:"

#: ../../docs/mode/usage-mode.rst:69 09ab8445d81144bd9d3a9f5ddd303e10
msgid ""
"对于计算资源使用量较大、有一定Linux命令行基础的用户，可以考虑使用\\ **公共集群**\\ 或者\\ **独占集群**\\ "
"模式。这两种模式都使用作业调度系统提交作业。不同在于\\ **公共集群**\\ 按作业运行时长来计费，\\ **独占集群**\\ "
"的计费从分配资源开始到资源释放，如果中间并未运行作业，依然计费。"
msgstr ""
"Users with larger workloads and some Linux CLI experience may use \\ "
"**Public Cluster**\\ or \\ **Exclusive Cluster**\\ . Both submit jobs via a "
"scheduler. \\ **Public Cluster**\\ bills by job runtime; \\ **Exclusive "
"Cluster**\\ bills from allocation until release, even if no job is running."

#: ../../docs/mode/usage-mode.rst:70 b182e131c3124f5398eb1f24c5e19b78
msgid ""
"如果对Linux命令行不熟悉，我们提供了\\ **独占/共享实例**\\ "
"模式，可以在“申请资源”处申请有交互界面的计算资源，提供了Jupyter等有交互界面的工具，上手简单，无需学习Linux，适用于无计算机背景的新用户。此模式优点是学习成本低，缺点是计费方式粒度粗，不适合有大量计算任务的用户。用户也可以前期使用这类交互界面实例，如发现计算量较大，建议逐渐迁移到\\"
" **公共集群**\\ 模式上，该模式计费更准确。"
msgstr ""
"If you are unfamiliar with the Linux CLI, use \\ **Exclusive/Shared "
"Instance**\\ mode: request interactive resources under \"Request "
"Resources\", with tools such as Jupyter. It is easy to start and needs "
"little Linux knowledge, suitable for new users. Pros: low learning cost. "
"Cons: coarse billing, not ideal for heavy workloads. You may start with "
"interactive instances and later move to \\ **Public Cluster**\\ for more "
"accurate billing."

#: ../../docs/mode/usage-mode.rst:71 2940e406d439425b8b5de34b71187f57
msgid "对于想独占计算资源的用户，可以使用\\ **独占集群**\\ 模式。"
msgstr ""
"Users who want exclusive compute resources can use \\ **Exclusive "
"Cluster**\\ mode."

#: ../../docs/mode/usage-mode.rst:73 2d6f0ac703eb4a2e8b10b5e164459915
msgid "综上，无计算机背景的新用户建议使用\\ **独占/共享实例**\\ 模式。下面将分别简述三种模式的使用方法。"
msgstr ""
"In summary, new users without a computing background should use \\ "
"**Exclusive/Shared Instance**\\ mode. The three modes are briefly described "
"below."

#: ../../docs/mode/usage-mode.rst:76 36dcdb1a1b264b649ad8dc2e627cd87d
msgid "公共集群"
msgstr "Public Cluster"

#: ../../docs/mode/usage-mode.rst:78 fe4a64e674e44a88af73828f34236b51
msgid ""
"公共集群以传统的作业调度方式提供公共共享的计算资源，所有用户无需申请即可直接登录使用。每位用户进入平台后就已经自动分配到公共集群的项目组内，“共享资源”中的"
" ``public_cluster`` 就是公共集群。"
msgstr ""
"The public cluster provides shared compute resources via traditional job "
"scheduling. All users can log in without a separate application. After "
"joining the platform, each user is placed in the public-cluster project "
"group; ``public_cluster`` under \"Shared Resources\" is the public cluster."

#: ../../docs/mode/usage-mode.rst:80 ae30f25cb76244a79c65c72e3af917e9
msgid ""
"用户在公共集群内使用资源时以作业提交的方式申请计算资源，通过作业调度系统将任务分发到计算节点上。用户在公共资源里只具有普通用户权限，可通过ssh客户端直接"
" :ref:`登录集群 <cluster login>`。"
msgstr ""
"In the public cluster, request resources by submitting jobs; the scheduler "
"dispatches tasks to compute nodes. Users have ordinary privileges and can "
":ref:`log in to the cluster <cluster login>` via an SSH client."

#: ../../docs/mode/usage-mode.rst:82 362d9de8210348d1a2f36e83a55b71b0
msgid "公共集群的登录节点配置了资源限制，请勿在公共集群的登录节点执行大的计算任务。"
msgstr ""
"Login nodes of the public cluster have resource limits. Do not run large "
"compute tasks on them."

