#: ../../docs/mode/usage-mode.rst:90 1270a0fcde344f9ab526c3abc90351bc
msgid "独占实例"
msgstr "Exclusive Instance"

#: ../../docs/mode/usage-mode.rst:92 a0e48f1793a04813ba58d5d6939048ea
msgid ""
"独占实例是用户独占的单机计算资源，用户在自己的独占实例中具有虚拟超级用户权限，这种资源使用方式可以提供远程桌面以满足图形化交互计算的需求。除了可以使用到普通的物理计算节点资源，这种实例可以使用到KNL节点等计算资源。"
msgstr ""
"An exclusive instance is a single-node resource dedicated to one user, with "
"virtual superuser privileges. It can provide a remote desktop for "
"interactive graphical computing, and may use ordinary physical nodes as well"
" as resources such as KNL nodes."

#: ../../docs/mode/usage-mode.rst:94 8bb0ad08f0064fbb836ff3092a647744
msgid "独占实例的申请流程如下："
msgstr "Steps to request an exclusive instance:"

#: ../../docs/mode/usage-mode.rst:96 6f533f4e7ffc4fb0b0da6eb5cc9a1c0d
msgid "点击“申请资源”，进入资源库，根据需要在过滤条件处选出自己所需的计算资源，比如Jupyter等，点击“创建实例”。"
msgstr ""
"Click \"Request Resources\", open the resource catalog, filter for what you "
"need (for example Jupyter), then click \"Create Instance\"."

#: ../../docs/mode/usage-mode.rst:98 269b019e14cd469d8342cbc5cd96643a
msgid "|image9|"
msgstr "|image9|"

