#: b2f1ae69dbd94ed9a27a593913a6a181
msgid "image9"
msgstr "image9"

#: ../../docs/mode/usage-mode.rst:100 54e0fba3e3234517b74bc5020f95c52a
msgid "填写该实例的必备信息。"
msgstr "Fill in the required instance information."

#: ../../docs/mode/usage-mode.rst:102 af065053ccc34a08a618f3ab8b817d4d
msgid "**名称**: 为该实例名称，用于分辨同一用户创建的不同实例。"
msgstr ""
"**Name**: Instance name, used to distinguish instances created by the same "
"user."

#: ../../docs/mode/usage-mode.rst:103 4c0a217cde0a46eb85cac48a1f9c94ca
msgid "**邮箱**: 用于发送平台通知，例如使用最长到时间即将到期时，将发送邮件通知用户。"
msgstr ""
"**Email**: Used for platform notices, such as when the maximum usage period "
"is about to expire."

#: ../../docs/mode/usage-mode.rst:104 c035c139adf84b659b6ab461d970ff50
msgid "**节点资源设置**: 用于设置实例的节点资源。根据实例的不同，可选的资源也不同。"
msgstr ""
"**Node resource settings**: Configure node resources for the instance. "
"Available options depend on the instance type."

#: ../../docs/mode/usage-mode.rst:108 28f63726326043ae925d179c9a3e3f0e
msgid "``CPU``\\ 是指实例要使用的CPU核数。"
msgstr "``CPU``\\ is the number of CPU cores for the instance."

#: ../../docs/mode/usage-mode.rst:110 51f474506895415abac9f1711ab38cb9
msgid "``GPU``\\ 是指实例要使用的GPU卡数。如果卡数为0.x的小数点，意为共享GPU。例如0.2卡，则系统会分配给实例1/5的GPU卡。"
msgstr ""
"``GPU``\\ is the number of GPU cards. A fractional value such as 0.x means a"
" shared GPU; for example 0.2 allocates 1/5 of a GPU card."

#: ../../docs/mode/usage-mode.rst:112 83e32366e1ef4c9da85e875ea1ecbf5e
msgid "``Memory``\\ 是指实例需要的内存数。"
msgstr "``Memory``\\ is the amount of memory required by the instance."

#: ../../docs/mode/usage-mode.rst:115 064425f9091e43e996192cdd58be701a
msgid ""
"**使用周期**\\ "
"是该实例默认最长使用期限。超过该期限后，平台会自动释放该实例的计算资源。在该期限内用户可以自由使用该实例，但该实例会一直计费。用户也可以\\ "
":ref:`手动释放 <release resource>`\\ 该实例的计算资源，结束对该资源的计费。"
msgstr ""
"**Usage period**\\ is the default maximum lifetime. After it expires, the "
"platform releases the instance resources automatically. Within the period "
"you may use the instance freely, but billing continues. You can also \\ "
":ref:`release resources manually <release resource>`\\ to stop billing."

#: ../../docs/mode/usage-mode.rst:118 7a9a88195e5047c6bf034b17877b4c25
msgid ""
"该模式从创建开始计费，直到自动或手动释放资源停止计费。为避免申请到资源不进行计算或者正在进行计算时超时系统自动回收资源，用户一定要注意“使用周期”和“通知邮箱”项，并定期查看邮箱中来自平台的通知邮件。"
msgstr ""
"Billing starts at creation and stops when resources are released "
"automatically or manually. To avoid idle billing or unexpected reclaim "
"during a running job, pay attention to \"Usage period\" and \"Notification "
"email\", and check platform emails regularly."

#: ../../docs/mode/usage-mode.rst:120 720fcc27face46218e604556a53ce5e6
