msgstr "In \"My Resources\", select the requested instance and start it."

#: ../../docs/mode/usage-mode.rst:125 e919dfc0f9594492847517be97a7b58c
msgid "如果平台当前可用资源已经全部分配完毕，该实例申请后需要排队等待分配，此时无法启动实例。"
msgstr ""
"If all currently available resources are allocated, the instance must wait "
"in queue after request and cannot be started yet."

#: ../../docs/mode/usage-mode.rst:127 8713e20fa7044d839cc937d331f69325
